            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/354eb1ade28a43831fbdca9fb1256756.avif?t=1745294229\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the first to try the game by signing up for the alpha. Website link in the bottom right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/957900b7f6f9e6facec2ae71753ad162.poster.avif?t=1745294229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/957900b7f6f9e6facec2ae71753ad162.webm?t=1745294229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/957900b7f6f9e6facec2ae71753ad162.mp4?t=1745294229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern Multiplayer and Co-Op <strong>re-imagining*</strong> of the classic game &quot;Future Cop L.A.P.D.&quot; built in Unreal Engine 5. You play a rookie cop in the Mech-Assisted Security and Tactics (M.A.S.T.) unit of the Los Angeles Police Department in the year 2195. Your journey begins in a combat simulator where you learn to pilot a police mech, utilizing a vast array of advanced weaponry and gear. Eventually, you will take the fight to the streets, reclaiming your city from the vicious gangs controlling the various districts and saving its citizenry from an urban dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*L.A.P.D. 2195 is an original IP [b][u]inspired [/u][/b]by Future Cop LAPD and not a remake. We are not associated with EA or the original development team in any way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/23e24d199b3c65f70f66bcd795d4c726.avif?t=1745294229\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/354eb1ade28a43831fbdca9fb1256756.avif?t=1745294229\" width=500 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be the first to try the game by signing up for the alpha. Website link in the bottom right.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/957900b7f6f9e6facec2ae71753ad162.poster.avif?t=1745294229\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/957900b7f6f9e6facec2ae71753ad162.webm?t=1745294229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/957900b7f6f9e6facec2ae71753ad162.mp4?t=1745294229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A modern Multiplayer and Co-Op <strong>re-imagining*</strong> of the classic game &quot;Future Cop L.A.P.D.&quot; built in Unreal Engine 5. You play a rookie cop in the Mech-Assisted Security and Tactics (M.A.S.T.) unit of the Los Angeles Police Department in the year 2195. Your journey begins in a combat simulator where you learn to pilot a police mech, utilizing a vast array of advanced weaponry and gear. Eventually, you will take the fight to the streets, reclaiming your city from the vicious gangs controlling the various districts and saving its citizenry from an urban dystopia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*L.A.P.D. 2195 is an original IP [b][u]inspired [/u][/b]by Future Cop LAPD and not a remake. We are not associated with EA or the original development team in any way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/649560/extras/23e24d199b3c65f70f66bcd795d4c726.avif?t=1745294229\" width=500 height=125 /></span></p>",
